course: dictionary
lesson: 8982
title: Sister: one word, three meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A word can have more than one meaning, and the sentence tells you which one is meant. The main meaning of «sister» is a girl or woman who has the same parents as you. «You can't get burnt when it's cloudy,» says your big sister, and comes home pink. She is a family member.
explain: Look for clues about who is meant. «Your dose depends on your age and weight, which is why yours differs from your little sister's» is about family, because it talks about your age and your little sister. The words around a word tell you its meaning.
explain: Sometimes "sister" does not mean a family member at all. It can mean a nun, or a senior nurse in some hospitals. Words like "half-sister" and "stepsister" are special family words: a half-sister shares one parent with you, and a stepsister is the daughter of your stepparent.
fact: A sister is a girl or woman who has the same parents as you.
fact: A half-sister shares one parent with you.
fact: A stepsister is the daughter of your stepparent.
fact: A sister can also be a nun, or a senior nurse in some hospitals.
fact: Other family words include brother, sibling, twin sister, big sister and little sister.
exercise: «Your dose depends on your age and weight, which is why yours differs from your little sister's.» Who is the little sister? | A teacher at your school | *A girl or woman with the same parents as you, who is younger | A friend from the park | A nurse who looks after you in hospital
exercise: Mia's half-sister shares one parent with her. How many parents do they share? | None | Four | Two | *One
exercise: Your big sister is 3 years older than you. You are 10. How old is your sister? | *13 | 3 | 30 | 7
test: «A sister is also a nun, or a senior nurse in some hospitals.» Which of these is a meaning of sister that is not a family member? | A neighbour | A cousin | *A nun | A grandmother
test: A legend says three brothers, Kyi, Shchek and Khoryv, and their sister Lybid founded the city. How many brothers does Lybid have in the legend? | None | *Three | Four | Two
exam: A stepsister is the daughter of whom? | *Your stepparent | Your grandmother | Your teacher | Your brother
